# Nothing in this directory is ever committed. It holds the Google
# service-account key GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE points at - a private
# credential, and this repo auto-commits and auto-pushes to a public remote.
# Belt and braces alongside the root .gitignore's *service-account*.json rule:
# this one holds whatever the file ends up being called.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
